## 8️⃣ Summary

| Component | Who Builds | Technology | When |
|-----------|-----------|-----------|------|
| HCL API Integration | Integration Agent | Node.js, Adobe I/O Runtime | **FIRST** |
| REST API Endpoints | Integration Agent | Express/Runtime Actions | **FIRST** |
| Add to Cart Button | Storefront Agent | JavaScript, EDS blocks | **SECOND** |
| Mini-cart | Storefront Agent | JavaScript, EDS blocks | **SECOND** |
| Cart Page | Storefront Agent | JavaScript, EDS blocks | **SECOND** |

